Z||000003||ChopTop||11-15-2000||05:53 PM||||Do coilovers allow the use of wider wheels and tires, if so how much?||||reg||5
Z||000004||batboy||11-15-2000||10:27 PM||||Yes, they do allow for wider tires. I'm not exactly sure how much wider though. If I remember right, my coil-over springs are 2.5" diameter and the stock springs have at least a 5" diameter at the top. The other two advantages are: you can easily adjust the height and you have lots of different spring rate choices.||||reg||1
